        "created_at": "2025-02-11T18:11:43.861Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I mean, “seats” are filling because no one’s charging for them.  Assuming it actually gets started up it’s just one of dozens, maybe hundreds of PbP games running over there, some of which last ages and some of which just kind of fade away or suddenly end - which is pretty much what happened to the last two Sentinel games there, hence the number of refugee players looking for another game.</p>\n<p>Try charging for GM work the way that other site does and you’d find a lot fewer takers.</p>\n<p>Best of luck getting in, regardless.</p>",
